DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260905
UID:0f4fd83c86acbfadeef27fe4f44bf452@visitsantarosa.com
DESCRIPTION:Tour de Fuzz is a fully supported charity bike ride through So
 noma wine country benefiting the Law Enforcement Chaplaincy Service in Son
 oma County. Riders choose from 32\, 62\, or 100 mile scenic routes\, with 
 full support\, SAG\, stocked rest stops\, and a finish-line BBQ with local
  beer and wine. The 2026 ride honors the 25th anniversary of 9/11 and the 
 chaplains and first responders who answered the call. Start and finish are
  at Luther Burbank Center in Santa Rosa\, and registration is $115\, $125\
 , o
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Center\, 50 Mark West Springs Road\, Santa Rosa\, 
 CA 95403
