DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Original Certified Farmers Market is a year-rou
 nd Saturday tradition in Sonoma County\, bringing together local farmers\,
  ranchers\, food artisans\, and neighbors from 8:30 a.m. to 1 p.m. This is
  not just a place to shop\, it’s a place to connect directly with the pe
 ople who grow your food. As a Slow Food Sonoma County award recipient\, th
 e market prioritizes integrity\, seasonality\, and true farm-to-community 
 relationships. Expect peak-season produce harvested just hours before mark
 et\, 
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Center for the Arts - Parking Lot\, 50 Mark West S
 prings Rd.\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95403
